ление прямо на площадке!</p>","en":"<p>-</p>"},"isRussianLanguage":true,"speakers":[],"talkDay":2,"time":"2025-03-01T11:30:00Z","talkStartTime":"2025-03-01T11:30:00Z","talkEndTime":"2025-03-01T15:00:00Z","trackNumber":2,"tags":[],"videoLinks":[],"complexity":null,"talkId":20007413,"experts":[],"hosts":[{"id":"428f82a6648447bbabe115bda49ddfda","name":{"ru":"Александр Кучук","en":"Alexander Kuchuk"},"personRating":50,"bio":{"ru":"<p>Преподаю во ВШЭ, преподавал в МФТИ. Team Lead, Java-разработчик.</p>","en":"<p>I teache at the Higher School of Economics, taught at MIPT. Team Lead, Java developer.</p>"},"speaker":false,"committee":false,"photo":{"id":"5b9ef070-70cd-4eca-9bd7-f82bb6bb6b3d","title":"photo_2024-04-02 16.28.42.jpeg","url":"/squidex/srm/5b9ef070-70cd-4eca-9bd7-f82bb6bb6b3d/photo-2024-04-02-16.28.42.jpeg","fileName":"photo_2024-04-02 16.28.42.jpeg","contentType":"image/png","details":{"image":{"width":804,"height":750}}},"contacts":[],"achievements":null,"isPartner":false,"contributorId":22000576}],"technicalTags":[],"type":"talk","scope":"regular","topics":[],"isServiceTalk":false,"partners":[]}],"otherActivities":[]},"__N_SSG":true}